+## Appendix: every non-PASS test, by bucket
+
+Written out so the next worker can check the counts against the JSON rather than trust them.
+
+**1 — `&v[i]` pointer family (10).** `mathcore-testTMath`, `mathcore-testSortOrder`,
+`mathcore-stdsort`, `mathcore-SparseDataComparer`, `mathcore-SparseFit3`,
+`mathcore-SparseFit4`, `mathcore-binarySearchTime`, `mathcore-testSpecFuncBeta`,
+`mathmore-testGSLIntegration`, `mathcore-testGraphFit`
+
+**2 — `Math::Random<T>` (4).** `mathcore-testMathRandom`, `mathmore-testRandom`,
+`mathmore-testRandomDist`, `mathmore-testQuasiRandom`
+
+**3 — MathMore's GSL layer (4).** `mathmore-testSpecFunc`,
+`mathmore-testStatFunc`, `mathmore-testMultiRootFinder`, `mathmore-simanTSP`
+
+**4 — three `std` algorithms (3).** `mathcore-stressTMath` (`std::generate`),
+`mathcore-testSampleQuantiles` (`std::shuffle`), `mathmore-testPermute`
+(`std::next_permutation`)
+
+**5 — k-d trees (3).** `mathcore-kDTreeTest`, `mathcore-newKDTreeTest`,
+`mathcore-testkdTreeBinning`
+
+**6 — `WrappedParamFunction` (2).** `mathcore-testIntegrationMultiDim`,
+`mathmore-testMCIntegration`
+
+**7 — `Minuit2Minimizer` (2).** `minuit2_demoMinimizer`, `minuit2_testADMinim`
+
+**8–22 — one test each (15).**
+`mathcore-stressGoFTest` (`GoFTest`) ·
+`mathmore-testInterpolation` (`Interpolator`) ·
+`mathmore-testChebyshev` (`ChebyshevApprox`) ·
+`mathmore-testDerivation` (`Derivator`) ·
+`mathcore-testLogLExecPolicy` (`IParametricFunctionMultiDimTempl<T>`) ·
+`mathcore-testTStatistic` (`TStatistic`) ·
+`mathcore-testFit` (`Fitter::LikelihoodFit`) ·
+`mathmore-testGSLRootFinder` (`RootFinder::Name`) ·
+`minuit2_testCovariance` (`MnUserCovariance(i,j)=`) ·
+`minuit2_testMinimizer` (`TMatrixT::Randomize`) ·
+`mathcore-stressTF1` (`cout.width`) ·
+`mathcore-testBinnedFitExecPolicy` (`max_element(...)->name`) ·
+`mathmore-testVavilov` (`(*a[N])[M]` declarator) ·
+`mathmore-testFunctor` (`WrappedMemFunction<T, double (T::*)(double)>`) ·
+`mathcore-testBinarySearch` (RecursionError)
+
+**TIMEOUT (1).** `minuit2_ParallelTest` — speed, not a refusal.
